--- USW_100_TS2_TS3 ---

Umbrella-sampling stage connecting TS2 and TS3 (see ../README), seeded from
../SMD_TS2_TS3/lmp_files/ and restrained on the combined cobh+cowh coordinate. Same
window/replica/WHAM layout as LFER_3_mg2/pph4/PMF_react_TS1/USW_100_react_TS1/ — see that
folder's README, substituting the coordinate. Note: at least one replica here also contains a
'COLVAR_bis' file and a nested 'inputs/lmp_files/<NNN>/COLVAR' set alongside the standard
'COLVAR'/'inputs/lmp_files/', left over from a partial re-run of specific windows; the
replica's top-level 'COLVAR' and 'WHAM/' outputs are the ones used for the reported profile.

Three replicas (rep1/2/3) — one README covers all three.

Note: this README documents pre-existing content; no existing file was modified.
